3
00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:11.339
One of the most important things you can do when building your materials is to make

4
00:00:11.339 --> 00:00:13.939
sure you make material instances.

5
00:00:13.939 --> 00:00:18.519
You can make sets of materials concerning as in parent materials concerning topics

6
00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:23.820
or groups of materials needed, such as say I made a parent material with all the

7
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:27.460
hard surface items in my environment.

8
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:33.060
Or I made a parent material for all the translucent materials in my environment.

9
