So to create that it's pretty easy.

12
00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:46.539
You right click any material and you can create a material instance.

13
00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:52.939
That material instance will inherit any properties that you've exposed in that material.

14
00:00:52.939 --> 00:00:57.340
And those properties should show up if grouped properly inside of the instance material

15
00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.990
